cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "FTIR Research Agent: a cited-literature agent and FTIR starvation-resistance model for Drosophila stress physiology"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Osaro"
    given-names: "Nosakhare Odionfo"
    email: "osaronosakhare@gmail.com"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-9778-1161"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/NosakhareOsaro/ftir-agent"
abstract: >-
  An LLM agent that answers research questions about Drosophila stress
  physiology and infrared spectroscopy from real PubMed abstracts with
  automatically checked citations, and runs the FTIR to
  starvation-resistance model from the author's MSc dissertation on
  uploaded spectra, explaining each prediction by spectral band. The
  tool-calling loop is hand-written and the agent is scored by an
  evaluation harness of 25 questions.
keywords:
  - FTIR spectroscopy
  - Drosophila
  - starvation resistance
  - machine learning
  - LLM agent
  - citation verification
  - bioinformatics
